  "description": "Photovoltaic module, 12 cells in series, about 0.997 W at 1000 W/m² and 25 °C (Voc 7 V, Isc 0.19 A, Vmp 5.6 V, Imp 0.179 A); single-diode model fitted from these values. Irradiance and cell temperature change while running; the symbol shows the power taken as a share of the maximum power point. No partial shading or bypass diodes",
